<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SKODA WINS CZK 1.53 BLN POWER DEAL.</title>
<headline>CZECH SKODA WINS CZK 1.53 BLN POWER DEAL.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech engineering concern Skoda a.s. said on Monday it had won a contract to supply a CZK 1.53 billion, 50 megawatt power and heat generating unit for electrical utility Plzenska Teplarenska a.s..</p>
</text>
